. Father also of Ate"}, {"au": ["Il. 14.434"], "lv": 1, "n": "", "z": "of the river Xanthus-1"}, {"au": ["Il. 2.491", "Il. 2.598", "Od. 8.488"], "lv": 1, "n": "", "z": "of the Muses"}, {"au": ["Il. 6.420", "Od. 6.105", "Od. 9.154", "Od. 13.356", "Od. 17.240"], "lv": 1, "n": "", "z": "of nymphs"}, {"ex": [{"c": "Od. 17.502", "g": "Λιταί"}], "lv": 1, "n": "", "z": "of"}, {"au": ["Od. 6.207", "Od. 9.270", "etc."], "lv": 1, "n": "", "z": "Protector of heralds. See under κῆρυξ in Lex. And of strangers, beggars and suppliants"}, {"au": ["Il. 8.133", "Il. 21.198", "etc.:", "Od. 5.128", "Od. 12.415", "etc."], "lv": 1, "n": "", "z": "See also <a class=\"cunliffe-xref\" href=\"#\" data-key=\"cei/nios\">ξείνιος</a> 1, ξένιος 2 in Lex. His scales. See <a class=\"cunliffe-xref\" href=\"#\" data-key=\"ta/lanton\">τάλαντον</a> 1 in Lex. His thunderbolts"}, {"au": ["Il. 12.25", "etc.:", "Od. 9.111", "etc."], "lv": 1, "n": "", "z": "Sender of rain"}, {"au": ["Il. 10.5", "Il. 12.279", "Il. 19.357"], "lv": 1, "n": "", "z": "Of snow"}, {"au": ["Il. 12.252", "Il. 13.795", "etc. :", "Od. 9.67", "Od. 15.297", "etc."], "lv": 1, "n": "", "z": "Of winds"}, {"au": ["Il. 11.27", "Il. 17.547"], "lv": 1, "n": "", "z": "And of the rainbow"}, {"au": ["Il. 1.399"], "lv": 1, "n": "", "z": "By lot (<a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"15\" data-line=\"187\">Il. 15.187</a>, 192) got the heavens and the upper air as his realm (but he is called καταχθόνιος 457). The attempt of Hera, Athene and Poseidon to put him in bonds"}, {"au": ["Il. 1.493"], "lv": 1, "n": "", "z": "Thetis goes to him on behalf of Achilles"}, {"au": ["Il. 1.518"], "lv": 1, "n": "", "z": "his promise to her"}, {"au": ["Il. 2.8"], "lv": 1, "n": "", "z": "sends Oneirus to beguile Agamemnon"}, {"au": ["Il. 4.70"], "lv": 1, "n": "", "z": "sends Athene to induce the Trojans to break the truce"}, {"au": ["Il. 8.1"], "lv": 1, "n": "", "z": "with threats forbids the assembled gods to help either side"}, {"au"